# Reinstalled inside the image by `bun install` - never send host node_modules as build context.
**/node_modules

.git
.vscode
.claude
docs

# Build artifacts - regenerated in-container (apps/web/dist is built by the web-build stage).
**/dist
apps/web/dist
apps/client/android
apps/client/ios
apps/client/.expo

# Runtime data / local secrets - never bake these into an image.
apps/api/.env
media-storage

*.md
